---
import { config } from '../site.config';
---

<footer class="border-t border-border bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-5 py-14 md:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="15" stroke="#0f1f3d" stroke-width="1.4" />
            <path d="M8 13l4.5 8L16 9l3.5 12L24 13" stroke="#145aff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none" />
          </svg>
          <span class="text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">WHERE ポータルサイト</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ash">{config.description}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 text-[13px] text-slate">
        <a href={config.links.whereWebsite} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-signal">WHERE 公式サイト ↗</a>
        <a href={config.links.prtimes} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hover:text-signal">PR TIMES（ニュース一覧） ↗</a>
        <a href={`mailto:${config.contactEmail}`} class="hover:text-signal">お問い合わせ：{config.contactEmail}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-border pt-6 text-[12px] text-fog md:flex-row md:justify-between">
      <p>&copy; 株式会社WHERE</p>
      <p>本ポータルはパートナー企業様向けの限定共有用です。取り扱いにご注意ください。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
